Package: sysmon
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.6), python3-tk, python3-psutil
Maintainer: System Monitor Team <sysmon@example.com>
Description: Beautiful desktop system monitor for Linux
 Desktop System Monitor shows real-time system statistics
 on your desktop with a beautiful dark theme interface.
 .
 Features:
  - CPU, RAM, Disk, Network monitoring
  - Temperature sensors support
  - Color-coded indicators
  - Always-on-top transparent window
  - Minimal resource usage
Homepage: https://github.com/Bakstag1337/solid-octo-fiesta
